  "description": "<p>From <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/issues/2040\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/issues/2040</a> </p>\n\n<p>TL;DR</p>\n\n<p>I have configured my session timeout for a long time and when long running client dies I don’t know the transaction ID to roll it back. When another user tries to edit it, I just see a 409 Conflict and I would like to see the transaction ID so I can roll it back.</p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Ensure the transaction ID is included in messages in the log</li>\n\t<li>Add a configuration parameter to enable displaying the transaction ID to the end users, with a default of being disabled.</li>\n\t<li>If the new configuration parameter is enabled, add the transaction ID to the outgoing 409 response body.</li>\n</ol>\n",
